  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;TOM FRERICKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tom Frericks is a former college basketball star known for his athletic build and charming personality, currently associated with Everton F.C. and the Saint Louis Billikens."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EVERTON F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Everton F.C. is a storied association football club based in Liverpool, mentioned in relation to Tom Frericks' possible involvement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINCH FARM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Finch Farm is the training facility of Everton F.C., referenced in a cryptic message sent to Tom Frericks."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAINT LOUIS BILLIKENS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saint Louis Billikens is the men's basketball team of Saint Louis University, where Tom Frericks played during his college years."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIVERPOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Liverpool is a city where both the pub and Everton F.C. are located, mentioned in the context of Tom Frericks' current situation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The pub is a dimly lit establishment in Liverpool where Tom Frericks is initially seen, providing a setting for the narrative."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUINNESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guinness is a type of beer consumed by Tom Frericks in the pub, adding to the atmosphere of the scene."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAINT LOUIS UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saint Louis University is the educational institution where Tom Frericks played basketball for the Saint Louis Billikens."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRAINING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Training is an event that Tom Frericks is scheduled to attend at Finch Farm, suggesting a dual career possibility."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0077</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COURT OF DREAMS: TOM FRERICKS' JOURNEY WITH THE SAINT LOUIS BILLIKENS&quot;">
